'''Humility''' is a [[divination card]]. A set of nine can be exchanged for {{il|Tabula Rasa}}.

{{Item acquisition}}

The card can also drops from the [[Heist]] unique item reward chest.
==Design attribution==
Humility was created by supporter [https://www.pathofexile.com/account/view-profile/OneTooMany-1648 OneTooMany].<ref name="attribution" />

